t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Biome\" title=\"Classic Biome\">Classic Biome</a> | Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1,270</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When unboxed it can be placed in the claim and changes after some seconds to another image</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.13.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 28th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Classic Billboard when bought is in a box and when unboxed it can be placed like any other structure in the claim and when placed it randomly select one image after 10-15 seconds.\n</p><p>The description says: Wowzers! A brand new happy home for happy people? For only 50tix!?\n</p><p>The Classic Billboard costs $1,270 at <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a>.\n</p><p>There are 14 or more pictures. Here are a few of them.<br />\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/91/Bloxflakes.png/revision/latest?cb=20230712142554\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"One photo what could appear in the Billboard\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/91/Bloxflakes.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20230712142554\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"123\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Bloxflakes.png\" data-image-key=\"Bloxflakes.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e4/The_Magickal_Witch_Shoppe.png/revision/latest?cb=20230712143031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Magickal Witch Shoppe\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"125\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"The Magickal Witch Shoppe.png\" data-image-key=\"The_Magickal_Witch_Shoppe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e4/The_Magickal_Witch_Shoppe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20230712143031\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5b/Get_Help.png/revision/latest?cb=20230712143218\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Get Help\" src=\"data: