-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/c/c3/TheGodbuilder.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20231012105919\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is one of many Structures that can't be Stacked. (No Increase/Decrease Content Button) The others are <a href=\"/wiki/Valentines_Balloons\" title=\"Valentines Balloons\">Valentines Balloons</a> (due to the fact that they were sold before Stacking was a thing) and Halloween Balloons.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260829230524\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.077 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.097 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 70/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019491/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.804      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   53.804      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:899-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260829230524 and revision id 16993. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Structures"],"links":[{"title":"Classic Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Classic Store","exists":true},{"title":"Valentines Balloons","exists":true}],"images":["Classic_Billboard.png","Classic_Billboard_1.png","Bloxflakes.png","The_Magickal_Witch_Shoppe.png","Get_Help.png","BloxMart.png","BoatAd.png","CrowbarAd.png","FlybugRepel.png","MansionAd.png","NukesforKids.png","QualityHomes.png","RobloxianWireless.png","RobloxNews.png","StudioAre.png","SupportRiseOfIZA.png","TheGodbuilder.png"]}
